<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">1 Peter</book>
  <para style="h">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Peter</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Peter, Jesu Khrist sawltak in, Pontus gam, Galatia gam, Kappadosia gam, Asia gam Bithinia leh gam tuamtuam a mikhual dalhzakte kiang ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian, i Pa theihkholh bang a Jesu Khrist thumanna leh sisan theh tang ding a Kha hihtuamna tungtawn a tel a omte kiang ah: Na tung uah hehpihna leh lemna hihkhan in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I Toupa Jesu Khrist leh Pa Pathian phat in om hen! Aman a hehpihna thupitak bangzel in, misi lak a kipan Jesu Khrist thohnawnna ziak in lametna hing mu ding in a honsuang nawn hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Goutan setheilou, ninbanglou, tultheilou, van a nou a ding a sit muhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hotdamna, hun nanung a lang ding a zohsa mu ding in, ginna ziak in Pathian thilhihtheihna a ven na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin khemna chiteng ziak in hun sawtlou lungkham tadih mahle uchin, huai ah nakpitak in na kipak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na ginna uh ze-etna, dangkaeng mei a ze-et nung nangawn a mangthang zel sang a manpha zaw, Jesu Khrist kilak chiang in phatna leh pahtawina leh thupina ding a hong hihtheihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mu ngeilou napi’n amah na it ua, tuin mu tadih kei mahle uchin, amah na gingta ua, kipahna gentheihlouh leh thupina a dim in na kipak mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na ginna un a tuppen na kha uh hotdamna na mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai hotdamna thu zawlneite hehpihna na kiang ua hongtung ding thugenkholte’n, a kankan ua, siamneltak in a zongkhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khrist kha amau a om in Khrist thuakna ding leh thupina honzui dingte a theihkholhsak lai in, bang hun a bangchi a hongtung ding hiam chih zonkhiak a tum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai thu in amau nasep kiseplou in, noumau nasep a semzaw uh chih a kiang uah theihsak ahita, huai thute van a kipan a sawlkhiak Kha Siangthou panpih in Tanchinhoih nou hon hilhte’n tuin a honhilh ua, huai thilte angelte’n leng vel a ut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak in na lungsim puan uh teng in pilvang unla, Jesu Khrist kilak chiang in hehpihna nou a honpuak ding lungke lou in lamen un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ta thumangte bang in, na theihlouh lai ua na nidanglai duhgawlna uh bang a omlou in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nou honsampa a siangthou bang in nou leng na tatdan tengteng uah hong siangthou un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Noute na siangthou ding uh ahi, kei ka siangthou ngal a, chih gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan khentuam neilou a michih nasep bang chiat a ngaihtuahpa Pa bang a na loh uleh, hiai lai a na tam laiteng un laudansiam in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na pipute uh piaksawn, na omdan uh bangmah hilou a kipan, thil sethei, dangka leh dangkaeng a tat na hi kei ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Belamnou gensiatbei leh ninbanglou sisan bang a, Khrist sisan pha a tat na hizaw uh chih na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amah leilung pianma in sehkholh in a om ngei tak a, himahleh hun nanung ah noumau ziak in kilak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah ziak in misilak a kipan kaithoupa leh a thupina pepa Pathian gingtate na hi uhi, na ginna uh leh na lametna uh Pathian a a om theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Unaute it taktak ding a thutak zui a na kha uh na hihsiangthou tak ziak un lungtang a phatuamngaitak in ki-ittuah chiat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chi sethei lak ah hilou in, Pathian thuhing gige leh om gige chi setheilou lak a piang thak na hi zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mi tengteng loupa bang ahi ua, a thupina uh leng loupa pak bang ahi. Loupa a vuaia, a pak a pulh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Toupa bel tangtawn in a om gige hi” chih ahi ngal a. Huai ahi Tanchinhoih nou a honhilh pen uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in gitlouhna tengteng, zekhemna tengteng, lepchiahna tengteng, hazatna tengteng, gensiatna tengteng tawpsan unla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />naungek suak thakte bang in khalam nawitui bangmah hellouh lunggulh un, huai a na khan theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa mi hehpihtheitak ahi chih na chiam khinta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah suang hing, mihingte deihlouh, Pathian theih a bel tel leh manpha ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah kiang a hongpai in, noute leng suang hingte bang in Jesu Khrist ziak a Pathian kipahlam kithoihna lan ding in siampu siangthou hi ding in khalam inn a leptouh in na om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in Laisiangthou ah: “Ngai un, Zion ah a ning a suang kiphamoh pen tel leh manpha tak ka lem hi; amah gingtate a zahlak kei ding uh” chih a tuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nou a gingtate ading in huai manphapi ahi, a gingtaloute ding in bel: “Inlamte suang deihlouh pen, huai mah a ning a suang phatuam pen a hong hita hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan, “Pukna suang leh dalna suangpi ahi. Thu kigente a zuihlouh ziak un a kisui puk ua; huchibang ding a sehsa ahi him uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh mial a kipan pawt a, vak lamdangtak a lut ding a nou honsampa hoihna na muhsak theihna ding un, nou zaw chi tel, kumpi siampute, nam siangthou, Pathian mite na hi uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nidanglai in nam himhim na hi kei ua; tun zaw Pathian namte na hita uhi; nidanglai in zahngaihna na mu kei ua, tun zaw zahngaihna na muta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Deihtakte aw, mikhual leh khualzin na hih ziak un kha dou nakpa sautnate tawpsan ding in nou k’on ngen hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jentelte lak a na tatdan uh kilawmtak hi hen, huchi in thilhihkhial a, a hon gensiat chiang un leng na thil hoih hih a muhte uh ziak in veha a om chiang un Pathian a pahtawi thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa ziak in mihing dan bawl peuhmah ah lutun; tungnung a om kumpipa kiang ah hiam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />thil hihkhialte tung a thuk ding leh thil hoih hihte phat ding a kumpipa’n a seh gam ukpate thunuai ah lut un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiai Pathian deihlam ahi, mihaite haina thil hoih hih in na hihdai thei ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nuamlen na hi ua, himahleh na noplenna uh khelhna khuhna ding a zanglou in Pathian sikha a omna ding in zang zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi tengteng zahtak un. Unaute it un; Pathian laudan siam un. Kumpipa pahtawi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sikhate aw, mi hoih leh mi nunnemte lak kia hilou in migiloute lak ah leng laudansiam in nou hon heute thuthu in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Min Pathian theihna ziak in thuaklouh ding thuak in lungkhamna a thuak teitei leh huai pen Pathian pahtak lam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nou na thilhihkhelh ziak ua vuak na thuak un, kuhkaltak in thuak mahle uchin phatna bang na loh ua? Himahleh na thil hoih hih ziak ua na thuak ua kuhkaltak a na thuak ua leh huai pen Pathian kipah lam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khrist in leng nou a hon thuaksak ziak in, huaibang hihding a sap na hi uhi; a khap a na zuihna ding un zuih ding a hon nutsiat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Aman thil a hihkhial kei a, a kam ah zekhemna leng a omsam kei;”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi’n a kou lai in, a kouthuk kei a, a thuaklai in a vau kei hi; diktattak a ngaihtuahpa kiang ah a kipe zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khelhna lam a sikhin a diktatna lam a i hintheihna ding in amahmah in tua sing ah a sa in i khelhnate a pua hi; amah vuakna golhte ah hihdam in na omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Belam mang bang in na mang ua, tun zaw nou hon chingpa leh heutupa kiang ah na kik nawnta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchibang in, nou zite aw, noumau pasalte thuthu in om un, huchi in a lak ua khenkhat in Pathian thu umkei mahle uh na tatdan uh zoh in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Laudansiam kawm a na tatdan siangthou uh en in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na kivatna uh pawlam kivatna samphek leh dangkaeng khi awh hiam, puansilh kivatte hilou in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungtang a mihing thuguk lungsim thunuailut leh nunnem puansilh setheilou a kivat Pathian mitmuh in a manpha mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchibang in tuma lam a numei siangthou Pathian gingtate’n leng amau pasalte thuthu a om in a kivan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sarah in Abraham toupa chi a a thuthu a a om bang in; thil hoih hih a, khemlauna himhim laulou a na om uleh Sarah tate na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nou pasalte aw, huchi mah bang in, numei zaw bel kitambaih zaw a hih ziak un leh hehpihna hinna tanpihte a hih ziak un, pahtawi kawm in theihna bangzel in na zite uh kiang ah om un, na thumna uh dala a om louhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Atawppen in, navek un lungsim munkhat in om unla, ki lainat tuah unla, thunuailut in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khelhna, khelhna in thukkei unla, salhna, salhna in thuk sam kei unla, vualzawl zaw un. Hiai vualzawlna tang ding in sap na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Hinna it ut leh nihoihte muh ut in khelhna lak ah a lei veng hoih leh, a muk leng zekhemna thu genlou ding in veng hoih hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Gilou nungngat san in thil hoih hih hen; kituahna zong in delhzel hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Toupa mit in midiktatte tung ah a tu a, a bil leng a thumna lam uah a dohzel hi, himahleh Toupa mel in thil hihkhialte a dou nak” chih gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thil hoih lam a phatuam na ngaih uleh na pawikhoih ding uh kua a om dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh diktatna ziak a na thuakta bang na hih uleh, na hampha ding uhi. A kihtakhuaina uh kihta kei un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh na lungtang uah Khrist Toupa in bawl un; noumau a om, na lamet pen uh hon dong peuhmah dawng ding in mansa gige in thunuailuttak leh laudansiam kawm in om un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sialehpha theihna siangtak nei un, huchi in nou a hon gensiatna lam uah, Khrist a na omdan hoih uh gen thanghuaite hih zahlak in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thil gilou hih ziak a thuak sang in Pathian hoihsak lam ahihleh thil hoih hih ziak a thuak a hoihzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian kiang a honpi theihna ding in Khrist in khelhnate ziak in khatvei a thuakta hi, midiktat in midiktatloute sik in a thuak a; sa ah hih sih in a om a, kha ah hihhin in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huai kha in suangkulh a kha omte kiang a thu a va tangkoupih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huai mite’n nidanglai a Noah damlai a long bawl sungteng a, Pathian thuakzohna in a ngaklai in thu a mangkei ua; huai long ah mi tawmchik, mi giat tui apan humbit in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan huai tui in Jesu Khrist thohnawnna ziak a hotdamna baptisma lim hon ensak a, huai bel sapum nitna siansakna dan hilou in, sialehpha theihna siansakna ziak a Pathian kiang naihna ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amah van a pai in Pathian taklam ah a om a; angelte, thuneihnate, thilhihtheihnate amah thuthu a omsak in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Khrist in taksa a a thuak ziak in nou leng huchibang lungsim in kivan un; sa a thuak khinsa in gilou a tawpsanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in tunung sa a a omlai teng mihing duhgawlna lam bang a omlou in, Pathian deihlam in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jentelte utlam hihna, huknate, sa utnate, uain hainate, zu khamnate, milim biakna kihhuaitakte tuma lam a hihsa teng hunta hen aw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai a amau nuambawl luatna bang a noute’n tu a na bawlsam louh uh lamdang a sa ua, nou a hon gense nak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amau mihing leh misite ngaihtuah ding a mansa kiang ah a tanchin uh a gen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiai ziak in ahi, misite kiang a leng Tanchinhoih gen a hih, sa a om mihingte bang a ngaihtuah in om mahle uh, kha a bel Pathian bang a a hin theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh thil tengteng tawpna a naita, huaiziak in na thum theihna ding un lungsim diktak pu in pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bang dangteng sang in phatuamngai tak in ki-ittuah chiat unla; itna in gilou tampi a khuhzel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Phunlou in kizintun tuah unla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Michih in thilpiak na muh bangzel un, Pathian hehpihna chiteng kem hoihte bang in huaite in nna kisepsak tuah chiat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi kuapeuh in thu a gen leh Pathian thute bang in gen hen; mi kuapeuh in na a sep leh Pathian in hatna a piak bang in sem hen; huchi in Jesu Khrist ziak in Pathian thil bangkim ah pahtawi in a om thei ding, thupina leh vaihawmna tangtawn in amah a ahi, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Deihtakte aw, na lak ua ze-etna thupitak hongom, noumau ze-etna ding a na tung ua hongtung, thillamdang na tung ua tung bang in lamdangsa kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khrist thuaknate thuakpihte na hihdan bangzel un kipak zaw un; huchi in a thupina a a hong kilak chiang in noumau leng nuamtak in na kipak thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khrist min ziak a tai na hih uleh, na hampha uhi; thupina kha leh Pathian kha na tung uah a om gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh na lak uah kuamah in tualthatmi a hih ziak hiam, midangte thilhih gensakmi a hih ziak hiam in thuak keihen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh, Khristian a hih ziak in thuakta leh zumkei hen; huai minpu a hih ziak in Pathian pahtawi zaw hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vaihawmna Pathian inkuanpihte ah pat a hunta hi; huan eite ngei a apat masak leh, Pathian Tanchinhoih thumang loute tawpna bangchi phet ahi diam aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan, “Midiktat nangawn hotdam liailiai a hih in, Pathian limsaklou leh migiloute koi ah bang a suak ding ua?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huaiziak in Pathian hoihsak bang a thuakte’n thil hoih hih in a khate uh Siampa muanhuaitak kiang ah kemsak hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in na lak ua saptuam upate kei na upat pih uh, Khrist thuaknate theipa leh thupina honglang ding tangsam ding in hiai bang in k’on hanthawn hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na lak ua Pathian pawl omte kem un; hihding a hih ziak hilou in, Pathian thu bang a utzaw in, punna thanghuai deih ziak hilou in, lungsim a deihtaktak zaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na tante uh tung ah kiliansak tuanlou in pawlte zuih ding a kibawlzaw in, kem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in Belamchingpa lianpen a honglat chiang in, thupina lallukhu tultheilou na mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in, nou valnoute aw, upate nuai ah lut un. Ahi, na vek ua na kisepsak tuah chiat ding in thunuailutna in kithuam un; “Pathian in kisatheite a dou a, kingaineute hehpihna a penak hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in a huntak a nou a hon pahtawi theihna ding in, Pathian khut hattak nuai ah kihihniam un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman a hon limsak gige ziak in na mangbatna tengteng uh amah ah nga vek un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pilvang unla, limsak un; na melma uh Diabol, humpinelkai humham bang in a nek theih ding zong in a vialvak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na unau uh khovel a omte tung ah huchibang thuaknate a tungsam chih thei in ging kiptak a om in, amah dou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan hehpihna tengteng Pathian, a tangtawn thupina tang ding a Khrist a nou honsampa ngei in, sawtloukal na thuak nung un a hoih bukim a honbawl in, hon hihkip in, a hon hihhat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amah kiang ah vaihawmna tangtawn in om hen, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka unaupa muanhuaitak Silvana khut in, noumau hanthawn leh huai Pathian hehpihna taktak ahi chih thei in, tomchik in na kiang uah ka gelh ahi; huaite ah ding kip un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Babulon khua a om noumau bang a telnu’n chibai a honbuk hi; huchibang in ka tapa Mark in leng chibai a honbuk ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Itna kitawpna a tawp in chibai kibuk un, Na lak ua Khrist a om peuhmahte kiang ah lemna om hen, Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
